<title>ITALY: MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS SAN MARINO 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS SAN MARINO 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>IMOLA, Italy 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Michael Doohan, riding a Honda, won the San Marino 500cc motorcycling Grand Prix on Sunday.</p>
<p>Japan's Nobuatsu Aoki was second on a Honda. Takuma Aoki, also of Japan and also on a Honda, was third.</p>
